# Line endings are part of this repo's contract, not a display preference.
#
# Engine and bench sources are hashed into runtime and evidence contracts;
# launchers/ run under bash on the Linux boxes. A checkout that rewrites LF to
# CRLF flips every one of those digests -- so source is never EOL-converted, on
# any platform. Without this file Git for Windows applies core.autocrlf=true
# from its system gitconfig and does exactly that.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Captured evidence and build outputs keep the bytes they were captured with.
measurements/** -text
*.log -text
*.gz -text
*.cubin -text
